This archive was created by extracting hw-arm64 from test_read_format_7zip_deflate_arm64.7z.uu
and hw-gnueabihf from test_read_format_7zip_lzma2_arm.7z.uu and then using 7zip 26.02 to create
an archive using two different bcj filters for these files:

rm -f libarchive/test/test_read_format_7zip_deflate_arm_arm64.7z
7z a -m0=ARM64 -m1=Deflate -mhc=off -ms=off libarchive/test/test_read_format_7zip_deflate_arm_arm64.7z hw-arm64 -y
7z a -m0=ARM -m1=Deflate -mhc=off -ms=off libarchive/test/test_read_format_7zip_deflate_arm_arm64.7z hw-gnueabihf -y

begin 644 test_read_format_7zip_deflate_arm_arm64.7z
